{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12368","headline":"送王使君移镇淮南 · 钱起","name":"送王使君移镇淮南","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"共许徐方牧，能临河内人。\n郡移棠转茂，车至鹿还驯。\n吏事嘉师旅，鸳行惜搢绅。\n别心倾祖席，愁望尽征轮。\n紫诰徴黄晚，苍生借寇频。\n愿言青琐拜，早及上林春。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12368.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12368","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}